      },
      "message": "PR queue: open pull requests across board repositories via gh, with missing preconditions\n\n`bf prs` lists open PRs for every GitHub repository the board knows about\n(active claims and recent entries, plus the current repository), through\n`gh pr list --json` with a 10 s timeout and no prompts, and states the\nexact unmet merge preconditions per PR: failing or pending checks, the\nmissing `REVIEW: approve <head-sha>` comment, a non-CLEAN\nmergeStateStatus, or draft. Tests use a fake `gh` shim on PATH and\nfixture JSON, so CI needs no GitHub credentials.\n\nPlan of record PR 8: ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:53Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
